# Generated edition PDFs (scripts/render-pdfs.mjs, decision D-34). The build
# renders them from src/content/editions/*.json, so they are never committed —
# not from a publish upload either. Everything else in public/briefs/, such as
# the LinkedIn signature image, stays in git.
public/briefs/THB_*_PDF_*.pdf
